VALUES ('mla-4-3-9', 'user-default', 'goal-aws', 'Skill 4.3.9: Sensitive Data Protection & Bedrock Guardrails', 'Domain 4: Operating, Monitoring & Securing ML & AI Solutions', 'Hard', 'https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/userguide/guardrails.html', 25, FALSE, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-14T14:47:00.125Z', 'Task 4.3: Secure ML and AI workloads and model endpoints', TRUE, 'Bedrock Guardrails enforces safety, privacy, and responsible AI across any foundation model. It intercepts prompts and responses to: 1. Block denied topics (e.g. providing medical or financial advice). 2. Filter hate, sexual, and violent content. 3. Anonymize or block PII (SSN, credit card, phone). 4. Prevent prompt injection and jailbreak attempts.', 'Exam Tip: Use Bedrock Guardrails to automatically detect and mask PII and block prompt injection. Gotcha: Assuming Bedrock Guardrails only works on Anthropic Claude. Guardrails works across ALL models on Bedrock, including custom imported models!')
